WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Crouching medium kick begins the low confirm.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.100
The first Rush cancel leads into standing heavy punch.

3
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.500
Standing medium kick connects before the next Rush cancel.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.000
A second Drive Rush cancel spends the remaining gauge and causes burnout.

5
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Crouching heavy punch follows the forward-heavy Rush hit.

6
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.500
Heavy Adamant Flame continues the cash-out.

7
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.450
The forward-punch follow-up connects before Super.

8
00:00:06.450 --> 00:00:13.550
Akuma’s Level 3 Super Art continues the combo.

9
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:14.050
The Level 3 finishes and leaves Ryu in hard knockdown.
